      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This feature is not removed. You were previously using what was called \"Advanced controls\" for Vive Controllers. To enable this you need to navigate to the SteamVR bindings page and select \"VRChat Default Advanced Bindings for HTC Vive.\" \n\n- [Official VRChat Docs](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/steamvr-input-20#custom-bindings)\n\nEdit* for anyone that comes across this in the future, Storfix seems to of solved their issue by manually resetting the SteamVR Bindings for VRChat.\n\n- Head to `(your username)\\Documents\\steamvr\\input` \n\n- Delete the `steam.app.438100_controllerType.json` files\n\n- Start or restart VRChat\n\n- Assign default bindings again",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
